Finding the entrance to Vlad's tower is something that you have
to do with either way of exploration (bottom-up, or top-down).
Knowing the level range where the entrance is located reduces
the amount of "necessary" scrolls to just 5, or 3 on average;
an amount that is not uncommon to have in one's possession. One
certainly cannot avoid that searching in all games and on all
levels; it depends on the actual game and we know the RNG can be
stingy at times. But note also that writing this type of scroll
is one of the most unexpensive (only 4-7 charges required).

